  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral and Integrated Assistance in Protection and Camp Coordination and Camp Management/Non-food Items (CCCM/NFI)/Shelter Targeting Displaced Populations in Sites/Localities and Those of Recent Shocks in the Sub-Prefectures of Bakouma and Kab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Central African Republic&#x2019;s (CAR) socio-economic and political crisis is at the root of a humanitarian and protection crisis extensively extended. It is marked by population movements and needs for increasingly important to cover in order to help save lives and restore the dignity of affected people. Through this project, IOM is providing lifesaving assistance including protection, camp coordination and camp management.</narrative>
  </description>
